.TH COGTRIX 8 "2026-03-30" "cogtrix 1.0.0" "Cogtrix Manual"
.SH NAME
cogtrix \- system administration notes
.SH DESCRIPTION
This page covers installation, upgrades, and operational considerations
for Cogtrix running as a user or system tool.
.SH INSTALLATION
Install from source:
.PP
.nf
    git clone https://github.com/NorthlandPositronics/Cogtrix
    cd Cogtrix
    uv sync
    uv run cogtrix.py --setup
.fi
.SH CONFIGURATION
See
.BR cogtrix (5)
for config file format and environment variables.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B ~/.cogtrix.json
User configuration.
.TP
.B COGTRIX.md
Project-level context file auto-loaded on startup.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cogtrix (1),
.BR cogtrix (5)
